# Stain_Dirt.obj -- procedurally generated placeholder (no texture on
# hand, same reasoning as Crate/Ivy -- see stainDirt.h). Flat irregular
# patch lying on the floor (local Y=0.01, a hair above the floor mesh to
# avoid z-fighting), roughly 0.7-1.2m across depending on scale.
# Every face vertex is written as v/vt/vn (this engine's OBJ loader
# (modelRenderer.cpp) always expects the full triplet and does not
# tolerate a bare vertex-only index).
mtllib Stain_Dirt.mtl
usemtl DirtStain
